As part of the move to http://wiki.lustre.org/, new pages are being created and content migrated, including the new page http://wiki.lustre.org/Mailing_Lists_and_IRC

I wanted to highlight that we have a #lustre IRC channel on the Freenode IRC network. Point your client towards chat.freenode.net and join #lustre, or use the Freenode Webchat in your browser: https://webchat.freenode.net/?channels=lustre

The IRC channel might be a helpful tool to coordinate work on the upstream kernel client. 

